</head><body lang=ZH-CN style='tab-interval:21.0pt;text-justify-trim:punctuation'><div class=Section1 align=center><p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:50.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:24.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体;letter-spacing:1.5pt'>黄冈师范学院<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:50.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:24.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体;letter-spacing:1.5pt'>大学生创新创业训练计划项目<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:50.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:24.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体;letter-spacing:1.5pt'>申报表<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>项目名称：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>胃癌病理图像弱监督分类与可解释研究</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>项目类别：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;1&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></u><span lang=EN-US>（1-创新训练、2-创业训练、3-创业实践）</span><span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>负 责 人：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>曾怡帆&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>所在院系：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>计算机与人工智能学院&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>专业年级：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>计算机科学与技术&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>联系电话：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>19838250350&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>指导教师：<span lang=EN-US><u><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>涂勇&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u></span>职称：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>　　　　　<span lang=EN-US><u><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u></span>职称：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>申报日期：<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;2026&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></u>年<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></u>月<u><span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></u>日<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:63.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:4.5'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly'><span style='font-size:15.0pt;font-family:黑体'>黄冈师范学院教务部<span lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span></span>制表<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-bottom:23.4pt;text-align:center'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:22.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:黑体'>填 报 说 明<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left;text-indent:28.0pt;
mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:200%'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'>一、填写申报表之前，请认真阅读《黄冈师范学院大学生创新创业训练计划项目管理办法》及其他相关文件。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left;text-indent:28.0pt;
mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:200%'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'>二、请实事求是、逐条、认真地填写申报表中的各项内容。表达应明确、严谨、简洁。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left;text-indent:28.0pt;
mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:200%'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'>三、“项目所属一级学科”应是哲学、经济学、法学、教育学、文学、艺术学、历史学、理学、工学、农学、医学和管理学12个一级学科门类中的一种或多种（跨学科）。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left;text-indent:28.0pt;
mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:200%'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'>四、“负责人及团队成员信息”第一栏请填写项目负责人基本信息。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=MsoNormal align=left style='text-align:left;text-indent:28.0pt;
mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:200%'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'>五、申报表请用A4纸打印，表中除签字盖章内容，请尽量打印填写，页面空格不够时请自行加页，做成附件附于表格最后，于左侧装订成册。申报表需提交一式三份，需经项目参与人员签字，指导教师和所在学院审查、签署意见并加盖印章。<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></div><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:
仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
